{"id":119958473240233,"name":"[UPD 🎃] DONT SPLASH ","desc":"DONT SPLASH V2\nDONT SPLASH, IT KNOWS\n\n\n\n\nDONT SPLASH is inspired by the eerie atmosphere of the Poolrooms and House of the Locust.","path":"/game/119958473240233-dont-splash","slug":"119958473240233-dont-splash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ebc8b7f180bc1985207fac1421dc5410141b34d439a14144c63b6d958c662f51.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7fe70f786eea50c96ec21cdf480fe750/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":64373,"visitor":15531282,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-23T15:55:49.944Z","creator":{"name":"slo7th","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6ad9ddbfc4748c5eca48dbe1","title":"Brandon's Game Hub","game":{"_id":"6ad9ddbfc4748c5eca48dbe0","gameId":119958473240233,"name":"[UPD 🎃] DONT SPLASH ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/33de2036d77675b63531d7ebadb6f9be9f606f5322542960d4c776b799d54ac4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-0689ccb932043bd8b4456ed1a7eb5d53-4f1d46b6823a.png"},"slug":"119958473240233-dont-splash","path":"/game/119958473240233-dont-splash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/33de2036d77675b63531d7ebadb6f9be9f606f5322542960d4c776b799d54ac4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-0689ccb932043bd8b4456ed1a7eb5d53-4f1d46b6823a.png"},"placeId":119958473240233},"slug":"UPD-DONT-SPLASH-Brandons-Game-Hub-232989","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":537,"executes":38,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ec56a8f2963ed1626a0ea87f58501b5893b2f608f664240e7e8722bd4ac986e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/119958473240233-1792662975736.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/119958473240233-1792662975736.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ec56a8f2963ed1626a0ea87f58501b5893b2f608f664240e7e8722bd4ac986e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/119958473240233-1792662975736.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/119958473240233-1792662975736.jpg"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-10-22T09:56:15.801Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-22T09:56:15.801Z","lastBump":"2026-10-22T09:56:15.801Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/BrandonLee2991/7f3dde1c589a763d329002cc6def30da/raw/DontSplash?v=16.2\"))()","features":"Brandon's Game Hub | DON'T SPLASH V1.0.0\n\nMade a simple ESP script for DON'T SPLASH. Nothing crazy, just something I worked on for fun.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPlatform, Item, Monster, Vault & Player ESP\n\nCustom draggable GUI\n\nIndividual toggles\n\nInsert to hide/show\n\nFor anyone wanting to build on it:\n\nI originally tried adding speed and jump modifications but eventually got bored and gave up lol.\n\nRan several tests with WalkSpeed, JumpPower, JumpHeight, and UseJumpPower. Speed kept getting capped around 22 during matches, and jump modifications caused rubberbanding.\n\nAlso tested CFrame teleporting, which worked for about a second before snapping back.\n\nSeems like the server validates movement, so basic Humanoid property changes won't cut it. If you're planning to add those features, you'll probably need a different approach.\n\nFeel free to improve it or mess around with the code. Just give credit.\n\n— Brandon Lee | V1.0.0","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"689fb5dd9f45c53430de239d","username":"kriptonic","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lvl":5,"status":"offline","id":"689fb5dd9f45c53430de239d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-23T15:55:49.942Z","profi